Hytale Launcher License Information
-----------------------------------

The included Hytale Downloader binary, the "Hytale" trademark
are the exclusive property of Hypixel Studios Canada.

This package ("hytale-downloader-bin") provides a community-maintained
wrapper to facilitate the installation and execution of the downloader
on Arch Linux.

The software contained within the Hytale Downloader is proprietary.
By installing this package, you agree to the Hytale End User License
Agreement (EULA) provided by the developers.

